19:08.606 --> 19:10.650
LUST BREAKER

19:11.317 --> 19:13.778
She's kitted with the Cowperon V12 Turbo.

19:13.862 --> 19:18.157
It'll take some buildup before she peaks,
but once she does, we're in the zone.

19:19.534 --> 19:21.202
What route we takin'?

19:21.286 --> 19:22.328
We go in and out.

19:23.037 --> 19:25.039
For a first-timer,
you'll want the quickest route.

19:27.959 --> 19:30.336
Here's to a sex-cess.

19:30.420 --> 19:31.671
Sémen.

19:35.842 --> 19:37.176
Let it go!

19:42.515 --> 19:44.517
Yo, I'm starving out here!

19:44.601 --> 19:46.436
<i>We'll go out for tacos later.</i>

19:46.519 --> 19:50.189
There's a top hole. And a bottom hole.
Which hole?

19:50.273 --> 19:51.441
<i>The top!</i>

19:51.524 --> 19:53.735
Road's got that fresh wax look.

19:53.818 --> 19:56.446
<i>Feels like a soaked battlefield
after a pulsing storm in here.</i>

20:04.996 --> 20:06.456
Now that he's gone,

20:07.165 --> 20:08.750
I'm left to lie here in the wet patch.

20:10.501 --> 20:11.711
I'm bored.

20:14.964 --> 20:16.549
Something's coming.

20:25.475 --> 20:28.102
Yo, this chick's half asleep,
and still she reachin' for the vibe?

20:28.186 --> 20:29.562
What a whorified mess!

20:35.735 --> 20:37.153
She came.

20:37.236 --> 20:39.614
She's going Initial G on the ceiling.

20:39.697 --> 20:41.574
Corman! She's after you!

20:41.658 --> 20:44.577
Damn it! Why's it always me?

20:44.661 --> 20:46.913
Oh God, and there's an oil leak!

20:49.916 --> 20:52.794
Gom, there it is! Crank that valve!

20:52.877 --> 20:54.212
I got this!

21:17.193 --> 21:18.569
Gom!

21:18.653 --> 21:20.279
Hold tight till I get there!

21:41.884 --> 21:42.885
Thanks, man.

21:52.645 --> 21:56.566
<i>You and me...
we were brothers at full speed.</i>

21:57.608 --> 22:00.319
<i>Racing down the same road at full speed.</i>

22:00.987 --> 22:04.449
<i>Then, at full speed,
we went our separate ways.</i>

23:37.792 --> 23:39.794
Subtitle:
Daisy Savage and Rychelle Brittain
